# Components no sample, project or template names yet (M-COVER).
# `Component | reason`. scripts/ci/capabilities.py --check fails for a component that is neither shown in
# a sample nor listed here, and for a listed one that a sample now shows (delete the line then).

Blackboard | state the engine writes and games read; nothing to author
ProcLevelOwned | state the engine writes and games read; nothing to author
UiScreenView | wired in the stock player and tested in tests/kit; a per-player HUD needs art, 09_coop has none
AudioListenerMix | tested in tests/audio; M-VIEWS step 5 shows it in samples/09_coop (a listener per player)
SharedCamera2D | tested in tests/kit/test_coop.cpp; 09_coop uses one camera per player (PlayerCamera), the shared frame is the other co-op style
VehicleSeat3D | M-OPENWORLD C1: tested in tests/kit/test_seats3d.cpp; the 1 km2 slice (E1, samples/09_openworld) shows it
Rider3D | M-OPENWORLD C1: tested in tests/kit/test_seats3d.cpp; the 1 km2 slice (E1, samples/09_openworld) shows it
Health3D | M-OPENWORLD C2: tested in tests/kit/test_combat3d.cpp; the 1 km2 slice (E1, samples/09_openworld) shows it
Weapon3D | M-OPENWORLD C2: tested in tests/kit/test_combat3d.cpp; the 1 km2 slice (E1, samples/09_openworld) shows it
Projectile3D | M-OPENWORLD C2: engine-spawned by Weapon3D; tested in tests/kit/test_combat3d.cpp
RoadNetwork3D | tested in tests/kit/test_roads.cpp; M-OPENWORLD B2 shows it in the traffic sample, E1 in samples/09_openworld
TrafficDriver3D | tested in tests/kit/test_traffic.cpp; M-OPENWORLD E1 drives it in samples/09_openworld
TrafficSpawner3D | tested in tests/kit/test_traffic.cpp; M-OPENWORLD E1 spawns city traffic in samples/09_openworld
Pedestrian3D | tested in tests/kit/test_crowd.cpp; M-OPENWORLD E1 shows crowds in samples/09_openworld
CrowdSpawner3D | tested in tests/kit/test_crowd.cpp; M-OPENWORLD E1 shows crowds in samples/09_openworld
UiFlowRules | tested in tests/kit/test_ui_flow.cpp; a sample screen reacting to a signal needs the Undertow ending, a later PR
Wanted3D | M-OPENWORLD C3: tested in tests/kit/test_wanted3d.cpp; the 1 km2 slice (E1, samples/09_openworld) shows it
Police3D | M-OPENWORLD C3: tested in tests/kit/test_wanted3d.cpp; the 1 km2 slice (E1, samples/09_openworld) shows it
FloatingOrigin3D | tested in tests/scene/test_streaming.cpp and tests/kit/test_origin3d.cpp; the M-OPENWORLD city sample (A4) shows it
Mission | M-MISSION 1: tested in tests/kit/test_missions.cpp; the three-mission demo (step 4) shows it
Objective | M-MISSION 1: tested in tests/kit/test_missions.cpp; the three-mission demo (step 4) shows it
MapMarker | M-MISSION 2: tested in tests/kit/test_map_markers.cpp; the three-mission demo (step 4) shows it
